  "backstoryCard": {
    "backstoryNotes": "Adult xenobiologist. Born on the Mother Planet Volar, Marara completed its studies at the Botanical Institute of Victar before setting out into the Great Ring. Driven by a deep spiritual and scientific curiosity, she travels the galaxy as a field researcher studying rare plant fungal, and exotic bio-ecosystems\u2014hoping one day to document living legends like the sentient planet Tygerion or the fungal hive-mind of the Xrototaxian. It is fiercely protective of natural planetary environments against corporate exploitation. It has pale green skin speckled with dark red age-spots, deep sea-blue eyes, and lush, leaf-like foliage crowning her head and shoulders, concealing a small dormant bud at her crown."
  },
